    "code": " s = input().split()\n\nx, y, m = (int(i) for i in s)\n\n\n\nans = 0\n\n\n\nif x >= m or y >= m:\n\n    print(0)\n\nelif x <= 0 and y <= 0:\n\n    print(-1)\n\nelse:\n\n    if x < 0:\n\n        q = abs(x // y)\n\n        ans += q\n\n        x += y * q\n\n    elif y < 0:\n\n        q = abs(y // x)\n\n        ans += q\n\n        y += x * q\n\n\n\n    while x < m and y < m:\n\n        ans += 1\n\n        if x < y:\n\n            x = x + y\n\n        else:\n\n            y = x + y\n\n    \n\n    print(ans)",
